  "description": "The target community is individuals who appreciate shock humor, gross-out comedy, and crude, taboo-breaking jokes. This includes viewers familiar with internet meme culture who enjoy humor derived from absurdity, sexual innuendo, and violating social norms. The meme is designed for an audience that finds humor in juxtaposing a serious question with an offensive, sexually explicit punchline, particularly those who are comfortable with vulgar language and family taboo violations as comedic devices.",
